WEBVTT

00:05:27.563 --> 00:05:32.330
to break into an abandoned mental hospital
on the northwest side of the city.

00:05:32.363 --> 00:05:35.663
Now, we’d never heard
of this mental hospital,

00:05:35.697 --> 00:05:36.863
and honestly

00:05:36.863 --> 00:05:40.163
it sounded like any "teenagers
breaking into a mental hospital" story

00:05:40.197 --> 00:05:41.530
you've ever heard --

00:05:41.563 --> 00:05:45.830
a wheelchair mysteriously following them,
doors slamming shut,

00:05:45.863 --> 00:05:47.130
creepy laughter.

00:05:47.163 --> 00:05:48.363
But remember,

00:05:48.363 --> 00:05:50.930
these kinds of stories
can be important arrows,

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:52.130
so we followed up.

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:54.897
And sure enough, multiple city records

00:05:54.897 --> 00:05:58.497
show that there was a poor farm
and almshouse

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.297
on the northwest side of the city,